{"id": "EUVD-2026-96555", "enisaUuid": "22ff072f-ee3c-337b-8dcf-4a5015196ccd", "description": "JeecgBoot through 3.9.5 contains a missing authorization vulnerability in the AiragExtDataController deleteBatch handler that allows any authenticated user to delete AI evaluator records. Low-privileged attackers can send comma-separated ids to DELETE /airag/extData/deleteBatch, which lacks owner or tenant checks, deleting other users' evaluator and test-tracking records.", "datePublished": "2026-10-10T21:49:15", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-13T18:51:52", "baseScore": 5.3, "baseScoreVersion": "4.0", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:4.0/AV:N/AC:L/AT:N/PR:L/UI:N/VC:N/VI:L/VA:L/SC:N/SI:N/SA:N", "references": ["https://github.com/AnkesKasty/cve-request-poc/blob/a7b6d1423555812d8efa26c91c5d0683164b31e5/JeecgBoot/poc_airag_extdata_delete_batch.py", "https://github.com/jeecgboot/JeecgBoot/blob/e3b9dc0aefe1943d9772b026f64ed671a7c82802/jeecg-boot/jeecg-boot-module/jeecg-boot-module-airag/src/main/java/org/jeecg/modules/airag/prompts/controller/AiragExtDataController.java#L138-L144", "https://www.vulncheck.com/advisories/jeecgboot-through-3.9.5-missing-authorization-via-airag-extdata-deletebatch"], "aliases": ["CVE-2026-108616", "GHSA-fjc9-j739-rv97"], "assigner": "VulnCheck", "epss": 0.27, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "45bfc4bb-8102-3c74-9b85-69c3580e4510", "product": {"name": "JeecgBoot", "vendor": {"name": "n/a"}}, "product_version": "0 \u22643.9.5"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "3df8d63c-136b-3029-93fd-5905ce1a8e16", "vendor": {"name": "jeecgboot"}}], "isExploited": false}